// FORMAT (Hex): Ddata(8) _ Daddr(1) _ Aaddr(1) _ Baddr(1) _ we(1) _ Adata_exp(8) _ Bdata_exp(8)
// we(1) serves as our write enable (1 = write, 0 = read only).

// 1. Write 0xA5A5A5A5 to Reg 0. Read A=Reg 0, B=Reg 0.
A5A5A5A5_0_0_0_1_A5A5A5A5_A5A5A5A5

// 2. Write 0x12345678 to Reg 1. Read A=Reg 1, B=Reg 0 (Should still hold previous).
12345678_1_1_0_1_12345678_A5A5A5A5

// 3. Write 0xFFFFFFFF to Reg 15. Read A=Reg 15, B=Reg 1.
FFFFFFFF_F_F_1_1_FFFFFFFF_12345678

// 4. Read Only Test (we=0). Read A=Reg 15, B=Reg 0.
00000000_0_F_0_0_FFFFFFFF_A5A5A5A5

// 5. Overwrite Test. Write 0x00000000 to Reg 15. Read A=Reg 15, B=Reg 15.
00000000_F_F_F_1_00000000_00000000

// 6. Write 0xDEADBEEF to Reg 5. Read A=Reg 5, B=Reg 1.
DEADBEEF_5_5_1_1_DEADBEEF_12345678